# Required THIRD-PARTY plugins per backend.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: aAmethyst was missing from survival for months. Nothing failed loudly —
# PizzaNetworkCore still sold the amethyst tools for $1.5M each and then dispatched
# `tools give`, a command that did not exist, so players paid and received nothing. The
# only trace was a leftover plugins/aAmethyst/ config folder with no jar beside it.
#
# Our own jars are covered by deploy_plugins.sh, which builds and copies them from one
# place. Third-party jars are installed by hand, which is exactly why they go missing on
# one backend and nowhere else. Listing them here makes absence detectable:
#
#   ./scripts/deploy_plugins.sh --check
#
# Match on the jar name PREFIX, since versions are in the filenames (EssentialsX-2.22.0).
# Add a plugin here the moment you install it somewhere on purpose.

# Every Paper backend needs these.
REQUIRED_ALL='LuckPerms Vault PlaceholderAPI ProtocolLib EssentialsX EssentialsXChat LibertyBans TAB ViaVersion ViaBackwards voicechat'

# Per-backend additions.
REQUIRED_lobby='DeluxeMenus worldedit worldguard'
REQUIRED_survival='amethyst Chunky GrimAC DeluxeMenus'
REQUIRED_maintenance='DeluxeMenus Chunky worldedit worldguard'
REQUIRED_dev='amethyst Chunky GrimAC'

# Proxy plugins (Velocity builds — a Spigot jar of the same plugin will NOT load here).
REQUIRED_velocity='LuckPerms-Velocity PizzaProxyGuard TAB ViaVersion ViaBackwards voicechat-velocity'
